YieldcoinShare_burn
├── when the caller does not have BURNER_ROLE
│   └── it should revert with AccessControlUnauthorizedAccount
├── when the user is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with ERC20InvalidSender
├── when the user's balance is insufficient
│   └── it should revert with ERC20InsufficientBalance
└── when the burn is valid
    ├── it should decrease the user balance and total supply
    └── it should emit Transfer to the zero address
